# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: journey-no-ignored-text >> invalid >>> docs/rules/journey-no-ignored-text.md incorrect 1
Filename: journey-no-ignored-text-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | journey
  2 |   section Work
  3 |     Make tea: 5: Me: Cat
    |                    ^~~~~ [1]
  4 |

[1] mermaid.js does not read the data of a task from its third colon and drops `: Cat`.
    Suggestions:
      - Replace the extra colons with commas.
        Output:
          1 | journey
          2 |   section Work
          3 |     Make tea: 5: Me, Cat
          4 |
---


